# Local review only, never committed: this repo is public on GitHub.
#
# ben.json is a real member's page, and img/ holds its pictures: his
# portrait and banner, LinkedIn post photos with other students in them,
# and company, school and badge artwork that is not ours to republish.
# They live here, outside public/, so no build copies them into a deploy
# either; the Vite dev server still serves this folder at
# /fixtures/portfolio/, which is all ?fixture=ben needs.
#
# The invented fixtures' pictures are generated shapes named fx-*, and
# those are committed.
ben.json
img/*
!img/fx-*
